    "Name": "Kalis",
    "Details": "A jack of all trades tank, the Medium tank is the generic stereotype of a tank. Intended as a scout or vanguard unit, the Medium Tank is constantly on the move, probing ahead of the rest of the troops.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar or Martian biomes due to using an ICE.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       130     25\n<b>Left</b>         100     25\n<b>Right</b>       100     25\n<b>Rear</b>         90     25\n<b>Turret</b>      130     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      550    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Rugged</color>",
    "Icon": "Myrmidon"
